```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant WebUI
    participant Gateway
    participant AgentLoop
    participant MemoryStore
    participant SessionManager
    participant MCP

    User->>WebUI: Select project workspace
    WebUI->>Gateway: Set topic workspace + access mode
    Gateway->>AgentLoop: New message with project context
    AgentLoop->>MemoryStore: Read SOUL.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md
    AgentLoop->>SessionManager: Load recent session (by workspace-id)
    AgentLoop->>MCP: Call @github, @knowledge-graph tools
    AgentLoop->>MemoryStore: Write consolidated memory (Dream)
    MemoryStore->>GitMem: Commit memory changes
    SessionManager->>Transcripts: Append turn
```